# ripgrep reads this file through RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH, which only the `rg` alias of mise-config/config.toml sets.
# An exported variable would reach every child of a herdr pane, the rg of pi and omp included, and --hidden would
# make their searches cover dotfiles. An alias affects only what is typed at a prompt.
# --hidden also searches .git, which holds nothing worth a hit
--hidden
--glob=!.git
--glob=!vendor
--line-number
--no-heading
